---
source: crates/leptoskit_cli/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "normalize(&stdout(&output), &scratch.path)"
---
Records the files in a prepared backend bundle. This does not build, sign, or attest the bundle

Usage: leptoskit verify record --bundle <BUNDLE> --out <OUT>

Options:
      --bundle <BUNDLE>  The prepared bundle directory; see the backend bundle guide
      --out <OUT>        A new inventory file outside the bundle. Prints its SHA-256
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
